     2	05-art77-scope	From 18 February 2027 each LMT battery, EV battery and industrial battery above 2 kWh placed on the market or put into service requires a battery passport with model and individual-battery data.	https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1542/2025-07-31/eng/	Article 77(1)-(2), lines 2846-2868	verified
