    45	## Evidence boundary
    46	
    47	No source found establishes a market price or recurring external budget among small Benelux second-life battery operators. The €12,000 sprint, €30,000 onboarding, €3,500 monthly retainer and conversion assumptions are explicit required-price tests. The Commission's stated future implementation timetable is not treated as an enacted deadline where the referenced act had not yet been adopted on 2026-09-01.
