   116	<li>European Commission, <a href="https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/single-market/digital-product-passport/batteries_en">Batteries and the Digital Product Passport</a> and <a href="https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/news/guidance-support-preparations-digital-batteries-passport-2026-08-21_en">2026 battery-passport guidance announcement</a>.</li>
   117	<li>European Commission, <a href="https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/single-market/digital-product-passport/dpp-registry_en">The DPP Registry</a> and <a href="https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/single-market/digital-product-passport_en">DPP implementation timeline</a>.</li>
   118	<li>EUR-Lex, <a href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj">Regulation (EU) 2024/1781 (ESPR)</a>; European Commission, <a href="https://green-forum.ec.europa.eu/news/2025-2030-working-plan-2025-07-11_en">ESPR and Energy Labelling Working Plan 2025–2030</a>.</li>
   119	<li>Siemens, <a href="https://developer.siemens.com/battery-passport/overview.html">Battery Passport API</a>; Circularise, <a href="https://www.circularise.com/battery-passport">Battery Passport</a>.</li>
   120	<li>Minespider, <a href="https://www.minespider.com/">Digital and battery passports</a>; Spherity, <a href="https://www.spherity.com/digital-product-passport">VERA Digital Product Passport</a>.</li>
   121	</ul>
